{"scene_id": "s02463", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s02463.fountain", "heading": "INT. BARBERSHOP - AFTERNOON", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "JOSIAH CRANE-OLUWASEUN", "names": ["JOSIAH CRANE-OLUWASEUN", "JOSIAH"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 13}, {"id": 1, "name": "JUDGE EUSTACE VANDERMEER", "names": ["JUDGE EUSTACE VANDERMEER", "JUDGE VANDERMEER"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 24}, {"id": 2, "name": "DEPUTY NED PRUETT", "names": ["DEPUTY NED PRUETT", "NED"], "gender": "m", "first": 7, "spoke": 8}, {"id": 3, "name": "BELLE ASHBY-OKONKWO", "names": ["BELLE ASHBY-OKONKWO", "BELLE"], "gender": "?", "first": 56, "spoke": 9}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. BARBERSHOP - AFTERNOON", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A narrow frontier shop with a tin ceiling, a single leather chair, and a window papered with hand-lettered notices.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "A pot-bellied stove ticks in the corner.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Dust motes drift through slanting light.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Outside, a wagon rattles by and fades.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "JOSIAH CRANE-OLUWASEUN (50s, barber, white apron, razor in a steady hand) stands behind the chair, lathering a brush.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "In the chair, face tilted to the ceiling and a towel tucked under his chin, sits JUDGE EUSTACE VANDERMEER (60s, silver mustache, pocket watch, boots propped on the footrest).", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "By the window, DEPUTY NED PRUETT (20s, star too bright on his vest, a rifle he does not know how to hold) leans against the frame, picking at a splinter.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're quiet today, Josiah.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a quiet town, Judge.", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was louder before the railroad stopped.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was.", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Funny how a place can go still all at once.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not all at once. A little each day.", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're a philosopher.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm a barber.", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Same thing, with sharper tools.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Josiah brushes lather across the Judge's jaw.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "The stove ticks.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Ned shifts at the window.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Judge, the stage comes through at four.", "name": "NED", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So I've heard.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is it true the man on it is--", "name": "NED", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Deputy. Hush.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sorry, sir.", "name": "NED", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We do not discuss prisoners until they are in the cell.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes, sir.", "name": "NED", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ned, bring that chair over. You're making the lamp nervous.", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Ned drags a stool closer.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "It scrapes.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "The Judge winces.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Josiah, how long have you been shaving me?", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Twenty-one years.", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Twenty-one. Have I ever once told you thank you?", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not that I recall.", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then thank you.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're welcome.", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Now tell me what you know about the man on the stage.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Josiah stops.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "The razor hovers at the Judge's throat.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know he used to sit in that chair.", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So you do.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know he asked me once for the closest shave I could give him. Said a man should face his end clean.", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Did you give it to him?", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I did.", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Hm.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Josiah resumes.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "The blade draws a slow line along the Judge's cheek.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Ned watches, open-mouthed.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sir, are you not afraid?", "name": "NED", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Of a razor?", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Of the man.", "name": "NED", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Son, in my line of work you learn that the man is never the thing. It is what he's carrying.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "The bell above the door jingles.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Everyone freezes.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "A woman stands in the doorway, backlit, her silhouette sharp against the white glare.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "BELLE ASHBY-OKONKWO (30s, riding coat, wide hat, a leather satchel on one hip) steps inside.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Dust trails off her boots.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "She removes her hat and shakes loose a mane of black hair.", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Gentlemen. I'm told this is the place for a shave.", "name": "BELLE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We're closed to ladies.", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then I'll be the first exception.", "name": "BELLE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "She sits on the stool Ned vacated.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Crosses her legs.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Looks at the Judge in the chair, the razor at his throat.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Judge Vandermeer. I wondered when I'd find you.", "name": "BELLE", "speaker": 3, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Miss Ashby.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's been a long road from Dry Creek.", "name": "BELLE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I imagine it has.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My brother was on the stage this morning.", "name": "BELLE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Ned straightens.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "His hand drifts to the rifle.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ma'am, I'm sorry, but--", "name": "NED", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Deputy. Put the rifle down.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Judge?", "name": "NED", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She's not armed. Not yet.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "Belle smiles thinly.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "She sets the satchel on her lap and unfastens it.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "The leather creaks.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Josiah's razor trembles against the Judge's skin.", "para": 10, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Miss, whatever's in that bag--", "name": "JOSIAH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 81, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a pardon, Mr. Crane. Signed by the governor. For my brother.", "name": "BELLE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "The stove ticks.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Josiah slowly lowers the razor.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 85, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "May I see it?", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["carefully"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 86, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You may.", "name": "BELLE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "She holds out a folded paper.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "The Judge takes it with two fingers.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Opens it.", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Reads.", "para": 12, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "His face does not change, but his hand does.", "para": 12, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 92, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "This is genuine.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 93, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is.", "name": "BELLE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 94, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then he's free.", "name": "JUDGE VANDERMEER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 95, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He's been free since Tuesday. I wanted you to hear it from me.", "name": "BELLE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Ned lowers the rifle to the floor.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "The Judge lets the paper fall into his lap and closes his eyes.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "Josiah stands behind him, razor held still.", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "The stove ticks.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "A wagon passes.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Outside, in the long afternoon, a stage pulls up and stops.", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}